    "type": "game",
    "name": "Time Enforcers",
    "steam_appid": 2718490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maniacal <strong>Chronolith, Imperial Ruler of the Trans-Dimensional Realm</strong>, is rewriting the past, and only you can stop his evil minions of doom from unraveling time itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Enforcers</strong> is an <strong>action-packed role-playing adventure</strong> blended with an <strong>interactive digital comic</strong>\u00a0designed to make learning history exciting and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a\u00a0<strong>Galactic Space-Time Continuum (GSTC)</strong>\u00a0recruit, you\u2019ll work under the guidance of <strong>HG Wells</strong>, Executive Director of the GSTC, and <strong>Professor CT Huygens</strong>, Director of Temporal Dynamics, to find a way to stop this madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the enigmatic Time Enforcer Agent,<strong> Samurai Warrior Kaizen</strong>, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Travel through time</strong> to a pivotal moment in Japan\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Engage in turn-based battles</strong> against Chronolith\u2019s minions who seek to alter the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Solve historical puzzles</strong> posed by Chronolith\u2019s lieutenant, <strong>the Inquisitor</strong>, to continue your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Experience fully animated cutscenes</strong> with voice-overs and narrations, timed word balloons, and thought bubbles to engage players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Meet a mix of real and fictional characters</strong>\u00a0inspired by history, each with a\u00a0role in the unfolding adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>kids and the young at heart</strong>, <i>Time Enforcers</i> transforms real-world history into a thrilling adventure. <br><br><strong>Can you stop Chronolith before the past\u2014and the future\u2014are lost forever?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maniacal <strong>Chronolith, Imperial Ruler of the Trans-Dimensional Realm</strong>, is rewriting the past, and only you can stop his evil minions of doom from unraveling time itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Enforcers</strong> is an <strong>action-packed role-playing adventure</strong> blended with an <strong>interactive digital comic</strong>\u00a0designed to make learning history exciting and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a\u00a0<strong>Galactic Space-Time Continuum (GSTC)</strong>\u00a0recruit, you\u2019ll work under the guidance of <strong>HG Wells</strong>, Executive Director of the GSTC, and <strong>Professor CT Huygens</strong>, Director of Temporal Dynamics, to find a way to stop this madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the enigmatic Time Enforcer Agent,<strong> Samurai Warrior Kaizen</strong>, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Travel through time</strong> to a pivotal moment in Japan\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Engage in turn-based battles</strong> against Chronolith\u2019s minions who seek to alter the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Solve historical puzzles</strong> posed by Chronolith\u2019s lieutenant, <strong>the Inquisitor</strong>, to continue your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Experience fully animated cutscenes</strong> with voice-overs and narrations, timed word balloons, and thought bubbles to engage players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Meet a mix of real and fictional characters</strong>\u00a0inspired by history, each with a\u00a0role in the unfolding adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>kids and the young at heart</strong>, <i>Time Enforcers</i> transforms real-world history into a thrilling adventure. <br><br><strong>Can you stop Chronolith before the past\u2014and the future\u2014are lost forever?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Save history before it\u2019s erased! Join the Galactic Space-Time Continuum and battle Chronolith\u2019s minions in this action-packed RPG and interactive digital comic. Travel through time, solve puzzles, and restore history in an educational adventure for kids and the young at heart!",
